su name cut from filename source during num duration to filename output be ceremony def
  exists su name cmd ob text "node command/srt_to_itinerary_pya.mjs" be text ya
  ob filename of from of this to name text sourcepath be text do
  ob filename of to of this to name text outputpath be text do
  ob text " \"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob name sourcepath to name cmd be plus do
  ob text "\" \"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob name outputpath to name cmd be plus do
  ob text "\" --name \"teaching cuts\"" to name cmd be plus do
  ob text of cmd be command do
  su name result ret
prah

su name cut from filename source to filename output be ceremony def
  su name result from filename of from of this during num 6 to filename of to of this be cut do
  su name result ret
prah

exists su name cut be export ya
